    "text": "Sold in North America from 9 May 2012, in two versions, each with cracked ice holofoil copies of a whole evolution line, Sandile, Krokorok and Krookodile from Black & White, or Shinx and Luxray from Next Destinies with the Luxio promo BW34, two Dark Explorers booster packs and a coin. None of these cracked ice cards is found in booster packs. Outside North America, Krookodile came instead in a Dark Explorers Three Pack Blister, and Luxio had come as a cosmos holofoil in the Next Destinies three-pack blister of February 2012.",
